      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPY TIPPY (7) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and two placings from 12 starts. Below best last time at this track (25.54) in a Grade 5, finishing a 5.5 lengths fourth. Looks suited here and rates on top. BENNY TRICK (8) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (25.81) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Should be about the money. MY WARRIOR (4) unwanted in betting but showed good early dash and led until late, finishing second and beaten a neck (25.59) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 450m. Expected to be in the finish again. SANDAVE STAPLES (1) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
